<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian dlr, bonds steady on imports data.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian dlr, bonds steady on imports data.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian dollar and bonds on were uaffected by news of a 1.0 percent rise in imports during December.</p>
<p>Market forecasts had centred on a flat result, and forecasts ranged from a fall on 2.0 percent to a rise of 3.1 percent.</p>
<p>The Australian dollar held steady at US$0.7809/14, where it was trading immediately prior to the data's release.</p>
<p>March 10-year bond futures were unchanged from their pre-data level of 92.570.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
